==Trivia==
*In mythology and theology, [[wikipedia:Leviathan|Leviathan]] is a sea serpent demon and described as an embodiment of chaos.
**In particular, in the ''[[wikipedia:Tractatus de Confessionibus Maleficorum et Sagarum|Tractatus de Confessionibus Maleficorum et Sagarum]]'', Leviathan is a demon that [[wikipedia:Peter Binsfeld|Peter Binsfeld]] associates with the capital sin of envy.
*Cartethyia refers to Leviathan as the "False Divinity".